<div class="flow measure">
  <p>
    You can usually find me on
    <a href="https://indieweb.social/@philhawksworth" rel="me">Mastodon</a>. I've
    stopped posting on Twitter, but
    <a href="/notes/">an archive of my tweets</a> lives on this site.
  </p>
  <p>
    You can also sometimes find me at web development
